== Effects ==
* Destroying {{E|Poop}}s causes them to explode, dealing {{dlc|nr}} 60 / {{dlc|r}} 100 damage like a normal bomb, but with a shorter range.

== Notes ==
* Poops are not affected by [[Bomb|bomb modifiers]].
* {{E|Red Poop}}s will not explode when destroyed.

== Synergies ==
* {{t|Brown Cap}} / {{A|Golden Trinket}} / {{I|Mom's Box}}: Each effect/trinket copy stacks adding another {{dlc|nr}} 60 / {{dlc|r}} 100 damage to the explosion per stack.

== Interactions ==
* {{T|Dingle Berry}} / {{I|Dirty Mind|n}}: Dips do not explode.
* {{I|Mr. Mega}}: No effect.

